**/.next
**/.turbo
**/storybook-static

# Local test and diagnostic output.
**/coverage
**/reports
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only service data and secrets.
apps/veritio/data
.deployment-envs
.deployment-secrets
